          "message": "`tokenA` is generated once by `makeToken()` at module/describe scope, but `beforeAll` can re-run in the same worker process with module state preserved — the hoisted value is reused unchanged on re-entry and collides with itself. Move the `makeToken()` call to the first statement inside this `beforeAll` instead.",
