    {
      "file": "e2e/hoisted-imports.spec.ts",
      "findings": [
        {
          "code": "no-mistakes(playwright-no-hoisted-unique-token)",
          "column": 7,
          "file": "e2e/hoisted-imports.spec.ts",
          "line": 4,
          "message": "`tokenA` is generated once by `makeToken()` at module/describe scope, but `beforeAll` can re-run in the same worker process with module state preserved — the hoisted value is reused unchanged on re-entry and collides with itself. Move the `makeToken()` call to the first statement inside this `beforeAll` instead."
        },
        {
          "code": "no-mistakes(playwright-no-hoisted-unique-token)",
          "column": 7,
          "file": "e2e/hoisted-imports.spec.ts",
          "line": 10,
          "message": "`tokenB` is generated once by `makeToken()` at module/describe scope, but `beforeAll` can re-run in the same worker process with module state preserved — the hoisted value is reused unchanged on re-entry and collides with itself. Move the `makeToken()` call to the first statement inside this `beforeAll` instead."
